        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit the balls and create combos!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number Crush is an exhilarating puzzle action game where you hit and knock balls with the same number together like billiards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hit balls with the same number to make them combine into a bigger number!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Add the number of balls that combine to your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Combine many balls in one hit for a combo! Your score will go up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Get more balls if they land in your pocket! A chance to improve your score!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Simple controls, just select a ball and hit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Aim for a high score within the stroke limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How big can you make the balls that accelerate and decelerate repeatedly?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit the balls and create combos!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number Crush is an exhilarating puzzle action game where you hit and knock balls with the same number together like billiards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hit balls with the same number to make them combine into a bigger number!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Add the number of balls that combine to your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Combine many balls in one hit for a combo! Your score will go up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Get more balls if they land in your pocket! A chance to improve your score!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Simple controls, just select a ball and hit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Aim for a high score within the stroke limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How big can you make the balls that accelerate and decelerate repeatedly?</p>",
